  "solution": "def binary_search(sorted_items, target):\n    low, high = 0, len(sorted_items) - 1\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sorted_items[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        if sorted_items[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return -1\n",
