  "solution": "from collections import deque\n\ndef bfs_distances(graph, start):\n    dist = {start: 0}\n    queue = deque([start])\n    while queue:\n        node = queue.popleft()\n        for nxt in graph.get(node, []):\n            if nxt not in dist:\n                dist[nxt] = dist[node] + 1\n                queue.append(nxt)\n    return dist\n",
