  "concept": "Walk downhill: repeatedly step against the gradient.",
  "prompt": "Write <code>gradient_descent(grad, x0, lr, steps)</code>: starting at <code>x0</code>, repeat <code>steps</code> times <code>x = x - lr * grad(x)</code> and return the final <code>x</code>. <code>grad</code> is a function returning the derivative at <code>x</code>.",
